graph TD
    USER((User / Client))
    DB[(PostgreSQL Database)]

    P1[1.0 Authentication & RBAC]
    P2[2.0 Product & Inventory Management]
    P3[3.0 Flash Sale Scheduling & Simulation]
    P4[4.0 Transaction Processing & Order Ledger]
    P5[5.0 Retail Analytics & Reporting]
    P6[6.0 Audit Logging & System Diagnostics]

    USER -->|Credentials| P1
    P1 -->|JWT Token| USER
    P1 <-->|User Records| DB

    USER -->|Inventory Actions| P2
    P2 <-->|Stock & Product Records| DB

    USER -->|Flash Sale Config & Run| P3
    P3 <-->|Sale Quotas & Events| DB

    USER -->|Purchase Requests| P4
    P4 <-->|Orders, Items, Stock Locks| DB

    USER -->|Analytical Queries| P5
    P5 <-->|Store Sales Records| DB

    P1 & P2 & P3 & P4 -->|Event Streams| P6
    P6 -->|Write Immutable Logs| DB
